&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/dewiweb/holophonix-animator-blender?style=flat-square&amp;color=10b981&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="Last commit" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/languages/top/dewiweb/holophonix-animator-blender?style=flat-square&amp;color=f59e0b&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="true" />
&lt;/div>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Port of &lt;strong>holophonix-animator&lt;/strong> as a &lt;strong>native Blender addon&lt;/strong>: create and play motion animations for Holophonix spatial audio tracks directly inside Blender&amp;rsquo;s 3D View. Complements &lt;a href="https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/audio-spatial/holophonix-blender-addon/" >holophonix_blender_addon&lt;/a>, which focuses on project management.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Import Holophonix projects (&lt;code>.hol&lt;/code>, &lt;code>.zip&lt;/code>)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Track discovery via OSC &lt;code>/dump&lt;/code> request&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Real-time&lt;/strong> animation (loop / ping-pong / once modes)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Simultaneous animations&lt;/strong> — each track runs independently&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Cue list&lt;/strong> — trigger, stop and blend animations on demand&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Motion models (extensible JSON): circular, linear, figure-8, spiral, pendulum, random walk&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>OSC&lt;/strong> output &lt;code>/track/{id}/xyz&lt;/code> in real time during playback&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Requirements&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="requirements">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#requirements" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Blender 4.2+ (tested on 5.0)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>OSC libs bundled — no external install needed&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Links&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="links">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/holophonix-animator-blender" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Language: Python&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>openagenda-slides</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/openagenda-slides/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/openagenda-slides/</guid><description>
